# Build context for the scraper image (docker-compose `build: .`).
#
# The scraper only imports aldis, BJs, tops, Walmart, units, collector,
# instacart_storefront and retention - so the webapp is excluded entirely.
# Without this, `COPY . .` shipped all of Groceries/webapp/ (Flask app,
# templates and tests) into an image that also carries headless Chromium,
# pandas and Playwright, which is dead weight and misleading about what the
# image actually runs.

webapp/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/

# Never bake config into an image, even though the real .env lives one level up
# and docker-compose passes it via env_file at runtime instead.
.env
.env.*

# Local scrape artifacts (see .gitignore) - walmart_search.json and friends are
# debugging dumps, not inputs.
*.json
*.csv

# Docker/CI files the image doesn't need
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
